// Shared box reboot policy (2026-11-03). Installed as
// /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/52unattended-upgrades-local, which sorts after the
// distro's 50unattended-upgrades and overrides it.
//
// Security updates already install daily. A kernel update only takes effect
// after a reboot, and the default never reboots: a patched-but-not-running
// kernel. With this, the box reboots ONLY when an update asked for it
// (/var/run/reboot-required), at 01:30 UTC (03:30/04:30 in Israel).
// Every container has `restart: always` and docker is enabled at boot, so the
// sites come back by themselves; post-reboot-check.service proves it.
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot "true";
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot-WithUsers "true";
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot-Time "01:30";
